---
import Layout from "@/layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="Return Policy | Purest Electrolyte" description="Every customer situation is handled personally. We stand behind what we make.">
  <main class="max-w-2xl mx-auto px-6 py-16">

    <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">Return Policy</h1>
    <p class="text-gray-500 mb-10">Last updated: July 2026</p>

    <section class="mb-10">
      <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed text-lg">
        At Purest Electrolyte, we handle every situation individually because we believe in taking care of you personally — not following a script.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="mb-10">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-3">30-Day Window</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
        If something isn't right with your order, reach out to us within 30 days of delivery and we'll work with you to make it right.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="mb-10">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-3">Opened Products</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
        Because our products are consumable, opened items cannot be returned. That said, if you're not satisfied, reach out and we'll find a solution together on a case-by-case basis.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="mb-10">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-3">Damaged or Incorrect Items</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
        If your order arrives damaged, defective, or incorrect, we'll send a replacement right away — no questions asked. Just send us a quick note and a photo if you have one.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="mb-10">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-3">No Return Shipping Required</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
        We do not accept physical product returns. If there's an issue with your order, we handle it directly — there's no need to ship anything back to us.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="mb-10">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-3">Sale Items and Gift Cards</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
        Sale items and gift cards are final sale.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="mb-10">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-3">How to Reach Us</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
        <a href="/contact" class="text-green-700 underline">Contact us</a> with your order number and we'll take care of you right away.
      </p>
    </section>

    <div class="bg-green-50 border border-green-200 rounded-xl p-6 mt-8">
      <p class="text-green-800 font-medium text-center">
        We're real people who actually care. Reach out anytime — we'll make it right.
      </p>
    </div>

  </main>
</Layout>
